{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended, but the road never stops. In this high-speed vehicular roguelike, you\u2019ll drive, fight, and upgrade your way through an undead-infested wasteland. Armed with front-mounted guns and whatever scrap you can salvage, you must push forward through procedurally generated rural roads, highways, and crumbling cities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Shoot, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're behind the wheel of humanity\u2019s last hope: a heavily armed, upgradable death machine. Keep your speed high and your reflexes sharp as you blast through zombie hordes, dodge deadly obstacles, and fend off raiders looking to turn you into scrap metal. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ultimate Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your tank, and keeping it in top shape is the key. Unlock new weapons, reinforce your armor, and collect helpful relics. Level up through permanent progression to unlock customisable vehicle features.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Roads, Endless Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Every highway, backroad, and ruined city is procedurally generated, offering new layouts, enemy encounters, and challenges with each playthrough. Adapt to changing conditions, find rare loot, and uncover hidden paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Action with Permanent Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a desperate fight for survival, but even in death, you grow stronger. Unlock new vehicles, weapons, and upgrades to give yourself an edge in your next attempt. How far will you make it before the road claims you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1913310?t=1759187652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/da12e6c8f896eea32d51ee6b9220e6ba03a0a3ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759187652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/464a7434e16be66ed627b35c54e105be2e79b667/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759187652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/464a7434e16be66ed627b35c54e105be2e79b667/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759187652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4064400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended, but the road never stops. In this high-speed vehicular roguelike, you\u2019ll drive, fight, and upgrade your way through an undead-infested wasteland. Armed with front-mounted guns and whatever scrap you can salvage, you must push forward through procedurally generated rural roads, highways, and crumbling cities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Shoot, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're behind the wheel of humanity\u2019s last hope: a heavily armed, upgradable death machine. Keep your speed high and your reflexes sharp as you blast through zombie hordes, dodge deadly obstacles, and fend off raiders looking to turn you into scrap metal. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ultimate Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your tank, and keeping it in top shape is the key. Unlock new weapons, reinforce your armor, and collect helpful relics. Level up through permanent progression to unlock customisable vehicle features.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Roads, Endless Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Every highway, backroad, and ruined city is procedurally generated, offering new layouts, enemy encounters, and challenges with each playthrough. Adapt to changing conditions, find rare loot, and uncover hidden paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Action with Permanent Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a desperate fight for survival, but even in death, you grow stronger. Unlock new vehicles, weapons, and upgrades to give yourself an edge in your next attempt. How far will you make it before the road claims you?</p>","developers":["Fletcher Poole"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/075fd7815c108bfdbb94e9e55cc22792dee56821/header.jpg?t=1759187652","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1913310/72912857/4e8f912aa55ba94e4c45246cf86ae7fd68dfe5aa/1759186113/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759186930","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1913310/72912857/4e8f912aa55ba94e4c45246cf86ae7fd68dfe5aa/1759186113/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759186930","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1913310/72912857/4e8f912aa55ba94e4c45246cf86ae7fd68dfe5aa/1759186113/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759186930","id":257208890,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208890/movie480.mp4?t=1759186930","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208890/movie_max.mp4?t=1759186930"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208890/c4cbd20467a4c45d487ab42bb5d530b47efeadd3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759186930","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208890/movie480.webm?t=1759186930","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208890/movie_max.webm?t=1759186930"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1913310/922528484/d45fcc00c74fae278da89e4b445b01aefe33d496/1759012673/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759013219","dash_h264":"https://video.a